@bankkk
go-to: editparamilitary
view-if: sh_banned == 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_banned = 1;
!}

Banned the KKK.

@unbankkk
go-to: editparamilitary
view-if: sh_banned != 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_banned = 0;
!}

Unbanned the KKK.

