@editpartysupport

- @editsupport: Detailed Support Editor
- @republican_supportraise: Raise Republican Support
- @republican_supportlower: Lower Republican Support
- @democrat_supportraise: Raise Democrat Support
- @democrat_supportlower: Lower Democrat Support
- @librep_supportraise: Raise Liberal Republican Support
- @librep_supportlower: Lower Liberal Republican Support
- @other_supportraise: Raise Other Support
- @other_supportlower: Lower Other Support
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@returnpartysupport
go-to: editsupport

@republican_supportraise
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_rep += 10;
Q.middle_class_rep += 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_rep += 10;
Q.rural_rep += 10;
Q.unemployed_rep += 10;
Q.freemen_rep += 10;
!}

Raised support for the Republicans.

@republican_supportlower
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_rep -= 10;
Q.middle_class_rep -= 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_rep -= 10;
Q.rural_rep -= 10;
Q.unemployed_rep -= 10;
Q.freemen_rep -= 10;
!}

Lowered support for the Republicans.

@democrat_supportraise
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_dem += 10;
Q.middle_class_dem += 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_dem += 10;
Q.rural_dem += 10;
Q.unemployed_dem += 10;
