@democrat_supportlower
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_dem -= 10;
Q.middle_class_dem -= 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_dem -= 10;
Q.rural_dem -= 10;
Q.unemployed_dem -= 10;
Q.freemen_dem -= 10;
!}

Lowered support for the Democrats.

@librep_supportraise
view-if: lib_formed == 1
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_lib += 10;
Q.omiddle_class_lib += 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_lib += 10;
Q.rural_lib += 10;
Q.unemployed_lib += 10;
Q.freemen_lib += 10;
!}

Raised support for Liberal Republicans.

@librep_supportlower
view-if: lib_formed == 1
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_lib -= 10;
Q.middle_class_lib -= 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_lib -= 10;
Q.rural_lib -= 10;
Q.unemployed_lib -= 10;
Q.freemen_lib -= 10;
!}

Lowered support for Liberal Republicans.

@other_supportraise
go-to: editpartysupport
on-arrival: {!
Q.workers_other += 10;
Q.middle_class_other += 10;
Q.immigrant_laborers_other += 10;
Q.rural_other += 10;
